00:05:42.849 --> 00:05:46.850
mean we know what the solution is under 1%
of our audience are members.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:53.169
I estimate as I said on the Joe Rogan show,
80 to 85 or even 90% of our audience can afford

00:05:53.169 --> 00:05:54.520
two bucks a month.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:06:01.820
If we grow our support from under 1% of our
audience to 3% any advertiser that wants to

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.770
boycott us can boycott us.

